// v76: each CotSC civilian now manages its own nighttime removal via QC75NITE.
// Area script remains responsible solely for its original daytime spawn positions.

// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// BETTER IMMERSION FOR BALDUR'S GATE - BG0200
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

// Watch Member at 2281,3006, facing west.
IF
  TimeGT(5)
  TimeLT(18)
  !Exists("BIB0201")
THEN
  RESPONSE #100
    CreateCreature("BIB0201",[2281.3006],4)
END

// Human-bodied citizen renamed Half Orc Citizen at 1091,2904, facing north.
IF
